            content: `<div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-purple-600 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><span>🔍</span> Searching & Sorting</h3><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-2 border-purple-100"><h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600">📖 Pencarian (Searching)</h4><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Mencari data secepat mungkin! <strong>Linear Search</strong> mencari satu per satu. <strong>Binary Search</strong> membelah data jadi dua terus menerus (syarat: data harus terurut!). Binary search jauh lebih cepat untuk data besar.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-2 border-purple-100"><h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600">📖 Pengurutan (Sorting)</h4><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Mengurutkan data acak. Algoritma umum: <strong>Bubble Sort</strong> (sederhana tapi lambat, menukar elemen bersebelahan), <strong>Merge Sort</strong> (Divide & Conquer, memecah lalu menggabungkan, sangat cepat).</p></div></div>`,
